{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/MV3_Logo.gif?t=1749294909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Set sail for adventure in this new installment of the award-winning Monument Valley game series, exploring an expansive and beautiful world of puzzles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Begin a thrilling new voyage into an enchanting puzzle world. Guide Noor, a young apprentice, through a world of shifting architecture and rising tides as she seeks to restore the fading light.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>DEFY PERSPECTIVE TO SOLVE PUZZLES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Twist gravity. Shift perspectives. Reshape ancient structures. Every puzzle is a new challenge in logic, intuition, and imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/Portal_Puzzle.gif?t=1749294909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CHANGE THE WORLD AS YOU EXPLORE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From serene temples to crumbling ruins, journey through mesmerising environments bursting with colour, mystery, and meaning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/work_of_art.gif?t=1749294909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SET SAIL THROUGH RISING TIDES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate across shifting seas. Your boat companion is the key to unlocking long-lost secrets and hidden paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/Fish_Eating.gif?t=1749294909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE COMPLETE EXPERIENCE \u2014 WITH MORE TO COME</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monument Valley 3 includes the full story at launch, with additional puzzles and chapters arriving post-release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/extras/Seasonal.gif?t=1749294909\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>\u2022 Solve mind-bending puzzles across breathtaking spaces   <br>\u2022 Discover new environments shaped by illusion and perspective   <br>\u2022 Experience a rich, emotional journey through impossible geometry and sacred light   <br>\u2022 Includes all future updates and content at no extra cost.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Add to your wishlist to be the first to continue Noor\u2019s journey as new chapters unfold.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ustwo games are proud independent developers, best known for the award-winning Monument Valley series, Land\u2019s End, Assemble with Care, and Alba: A Wildlife Adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3132930?t=1749294909","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749294909","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/ca817500efa32715861d104e3bcf8f5eb2965ee9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749294909","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3132930/ca817500efa32715861d104e3bcf8f5eb2965ee9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749294909","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievem